Nicky Larson)", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "7", "text": "La vie, \u00e7a file vite hein, comme la bouteille en club", "rhyme": "9b", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "8", "text": "J'essaie, j'r\u00e9essaie mais j'tourne en rond", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Le gars veut pas hausser l'taro", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "10", "text": "J'suis pas press\u00e9, sers un jus d'orange press\u00e9es", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "11", "text": "J'connais le processus, \u00e0 la fin, il donne ses thunes", "rhyme": "yn", "persona_id": "001"}]}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Tu bouges la t\u00eate, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Bo\u00eete automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Inspi' automatique, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Amour, haine, c'est automatique, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Bouge la t\u00eate, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Amour, haine, c'est automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Tu bouges la t\u00eate, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Amour, haine, c'est automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Bouge la t\u00eate, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Amour, haine, c'est automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "10", "text": "Tu bouges la t\u00eate, automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}, {"n": "11", "text": "Amour, haine, c'est automatique", "rhyme": "ik", "persona_id": "001"}]}], "album_id": 303562}